-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p>A TV that plays in the lounge, a looping brand film on the lobby wall, a\nfountain you can hear before you see it. In 2.7 a scene&#39;s owner puts a\n<strong>video on any surface</strong> and <strong>sound anywhere in the room</strong>, and every\nvisitor — in the viewer, in a private share, in an embed — gets playing\nscreens that glow and audio that sits where its source is. WebGPU and WebGL2;\nstreamed scenes (the <code>.vpk</code> your upload compiles to).</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-need\">What you need<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-you-need\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>A scene you own (signed in at <code>/studio</code>; upload or claim it).</li><li>A video: <strong>mp4 (H.264) or webm</strong>, up to <strong>200 MB</strong>. Any size — the engine\nsamples it at 512², so 720p is plenty; a 4K file only costs bandwidth.</li><li>Optional sound: <strong>mp3, m4a, ogg or wav</strong>, up to <strong>20 MB</strong> per clip.</li></ul>\n<p>Files you upload are stored with the scene (<code>ingest/&lt;id&gt;.media/&lt;n&gt;.mp4</code>),\nserved under its visibility (a private scene&#39;s video needs the share\ntoken, like its model) and deleted with it. You can also point at a file\nalready on the same host; cross-origin URLs are refused (the frame is\nread back on the GPU and must not be tainted).</p>\n<h2 id=\"put-a-video-on-a-surface\">Put a video on a surface<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#put-a-video-on-a-surface\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>Open the scene with <code>?author=1</code> (the Author bar appears; sign in first).</li><li>Click <strong>Media</strong> in the scene chrome, then <strong>Pick a surface</strong>.</li><li>Click the surface — the panel shows <em>Material N — give it a video</em>.</li><li>Paste a same-origin URL <strong>or</strong> choose a file, then <strong>Add</strong>. The upload\nruns, the table saves, and the screen starts playing right away.</li><li>Adjust <strong>Glow</strong> (0 = the frame as is; 1 is the default, up to 4). The\nscreen is self-lit either way — it reads the same in a baked room as in\na live-lit one. Tick <strong>Sound from this screen</strong> to play the video&#39;s own\ntrack from the surface.</li></ol>\n<p>The video covers the material&#39;s whole UV range the way its baked texture\ndid: a screen modelled as one quad with 0–1 UVs shows the full frame; a\nmaterial shared by several objects shows it on all of them. Up to <strong>four</strong>\nscreens per scene.</p>\n<h2 id=\"place-an-ambient-sound\">Place an ambient sound<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#place-an-ambient-sound\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li><strong>Media → Place ambient sound</strong>, then click where the sound lives (the\nfountain&#39;s basin, the speaker on the shelf).</li><li>Paste a URL or choose a clip, <strong>Add</strong>.</li><li>Set <strong>Radius</strong> — the distance at which it fades to silence (linear) —\nand <strong>Gain</strong>.</li></ol>\n<h2 id=\"what-visitors-get\">What visitors get<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-visitors-get\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>Screens play muted and loop. A screen pauses when it is behind the\nvisitor or farther than 40 m, and resumes the moment it is in view.\nVisitors with <em>reduce motion</em> set in their OS see one still frame.</li><li>A <strong>Sound</strong> chip appears in the scene chrome whenever the scene has\naudio. Browsers will not play sound until the visitor clicks something:\nthe chip is that click, and the global mute. Each source is positioned\n(HRTF) and follows the camera as the visitor walks.</li><li>Everything is in the share link already — the table is stored with the\nscene and follows it through versions (a new upload keeps its screens).</li></ul>\n<h2 id=\"from-code\">From code<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#from-code\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"doc-code\" data-lang=\"js\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code class=\"lang-js\">// Node / browser SDK — the same thing the Media panel does.\nconst clip = await verse.scenes.uploadMedia(id, mp4Bytes, &quot;video/mp4&quot;);\nawait verse.scenes.setMedia(id, {\n  media: [{ material: 3, url: `/${clip.path}`, emissive: 1.5, audio: true }],\n  audio: [{ pos: [2, 1.2, -1], url: &quot;/ingest/abc.media/2.mp3&quot;, radius: 6, gain: 0.8 }],\n});\n\n// Embed SDK — swap the table live (not saved), drive the mute.\nviewer.setMedia({ media: [{ material: 3, url: &quot;/ingest/abc.media/1.mp4&quot; }], audio: [] });\nviewer.on(&quot;media&quot;, (m) =&gt; console.log(m));\nviewer.setAudioMuted(false); // after a click in your page</code></pre></div>\n<p>API: <a href=\"/docs/api#media-surfaces-spatial-audio-2-7\" id=\"lnk-get-put-v1-scenes-media-post-media-uploa\"><code>GET/PUT /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/media</code>, <code>POST …/media/upload</code></a>.\nEmbed: <a href=\"/docs/embed-sdk#setmedia-table-getmedia-setaudiomuted-muted\" id=\"lnk-setmedia-getmedia-setaudiomuted\"><code>setMedia</code> / <code>getMedia</code> / <code>setAudioMuted</code></a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"limits-honestly\">Limits, honestly<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#limits-honestly\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li>Four screens per scene; frames are sampled at 512² and at most 30 fps,\nand a frame is dropped rather than queued when the previous one is\nstill on its way to the GPU. Expect ~1–2 ms of render-worker time per\nplaying screen per frame.</li><li>A screen is self-lit, not a light: it does not light the room, is not\nreflected by the environment probe, and the cinematic path tracer\nrenders the material&#39;s own base colour.</li><li>Sound has no occlusion — a wall does not muffle it; use the radius.</li><li>Media must be same-origin. Classic GLB scenes (not streamed) have no\nmedia surfaces.</li><li>The owner&#39;s Media panel lives in the playground; embeds play the table\nand take <code>setMedia</code> from the host page but do not author.</li></ul></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#what-you-need\" id=\"lnk-what-you-need\">What you need</a><a href=\"#put-a-video-on-a-surface\" id=\"lnk-put-a-video-on-a-surface\">Put a video on a surface</a><a href=\"#place-an-ambient-sound\" id=\"lnk-place-an-ambient-sound\">Place an ambient sound</a><a href=\"#what-visitors-get\" id=\"lnk-what-visitors-get\">What visitors get</a><a href=\"#from-code\" id=\"lnk-from-code\">From code</a><a href=\"#limits-honestly\" id=\"lnk-limits-honestly\">Limits, honestly</a></aside></section>"}